  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "59",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 59"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "59",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omobani okonachera abanto ekiina ase engencho y’ebibe biabo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naama! Okoboko kw’Omonene tikori okweng’e, erinde ere asinywe gotooria, gose amato aye tatineti atanyare koigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taibo, obobe bwaino nabwo bwabaatananire korwa ase Nyasae oino. Ebibe biaino biagerire Omonene obisire obosio bwaye korwa ase more, ase igo tari koigwa ogosaba kwaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaboko aino abeire ayatachenegeti ase ogoitera amanyinga ’abaanto, na ebiara biaino biabeire ebitachenegeti ase engencho y’obobe, Nigo mogokwana oborimo nebikoba biaino, ne chimeme chiaino chisokia aya atari ay’oboronge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onde tari ogokwana ay’oboronge, onde tari omonyakeene ase ekegambero. Abanto abwo nigo begenete amang’ana abosa na gokwana oborimo; nigo bakoba barito b’ayare amabe, baibora ogosirigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo bagoturagia amagena ’amarubi na koroisia chiusi chi’echinyambobe. Oyo okoria amagena abo nigo agokwa, na ekero rigena erimo ri’ayio riatirwe rirubi nigo rigosoka korwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiusi chiria bakoroisia ng’a chibe chianga, korende chianga echio tichigotuba emebere y’abanto. Emeremo y’abanto abwo nigo ere ey’ebibe, nigo benaretie gokora ay’obotindi namaboko abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amagoro abo nigo are amaango ase ogokora amabe; nigo bakoayerera goitera amanyinga ’abaanto batari na komocha. Ebirengererio biabo nebi’ebibe. Ogosaria na ogosiria nigo bire ase chinchera chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abwo tibamanyeti enchera y’omorembe, na oboronge tibori ase bagoeta; nigo bagoeta ase chinchera chinkorekanu, na onde bwensi ogoeterao takomanya amang’ana ’omorembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abanto bakoorokia ebibe biabo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, okogaamba ebiina bi’ekeene nigo gotobeerete aare, na oboronge tibori gotoikeeria. Nigo togosemeria ng’a torore oborabu, korende twarora omosunte; nigo togosemeria ng’a torore omobaso, korende twataara ase omosunte ekerima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo tokona‐gotaba‐taba ase enyasi y’enyomba buna abanto emeuko, nigo tokona‐kouna‐una buna abatabwati amaiso; intwe nigo tokogochwa mobaso gati buna mbwamura‐murire. Ase egati y’abare ne chinguru nigo tonga buna abakwete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intwe twensi nigo tokwamuma buna chidubu, na tweumia buna amaruma; nigo toganetie ay’oboronge, korende tibori aande; nigo toganetie ogotooreka, korende nigo kore aare naintwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogosaria gwaito kwamentekanire na kwabuchire ase obosio bwao, na ebibe biaito biatobereire birori. Ogosaria gwaito nigo kore amo naintwe, twamanyire obobe bwaito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twasaririe na komokan’Omonene, twairanire magega, twatigire komobwatia Nyasae oito; nigo togokwana amang’ana ay’ogokorera abande bobe, na ay’ogotaigwera; nigo togokwana amang’ana ’obong’ainereria akorwa ase chinkoro chiaito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okogaamba ebiina bi’ekeene gwatugutirwe gochia magega, na oboronge nigo bobeerete aare. Ekeene, giatiringeirwe inse, giatugutirwe ase amakoori, oboronge tibori konyora ribaga bosoe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekeene kiaborire, na oyo ogotiga obobe nere ogwoswa oirwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omonene okwebeeka ang’e gotooria abanto baye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omonene ororire ng’a ekeene tikeri gokorwa, na amang’ana ayio amogechirie mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akarora ng’a monto onde tarenge aande, agakumia ng’a onde tarenge gwesoyia gokonya. Erio okoboko kwaye omonyene gokamorentera ogotooreka, na oboronge bwaye bokamokonya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akeboyia oboronge bokaba buna engobo y’ekioma ase egekuba kiaye, akabeeka ogotooreka gokaba buna ekegogwa gi’ekioma ase omotwe oye, akeboyia egesiomba gekaba eanga yaye, naende akeboyia ekeririanda gekaba ekiambaro kiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nabaakane koreng’ana buna ogokora kwabo kore. Nabe nendamwamu ase abwo bakomoengereria, naakane ababisa baye koreng’ana nogokora kwabo; abanto b’ebisinka na abe chinse chire ang’e ne chinyancha nabaakane koreng’ana nogokora kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto ba bosongo mbairoke erieta ri’Omonene, na aba moocha bairoke obonene bwaye. Ekero ababisa barachiche buna orooche rokominyoka, omwaga Omonene nobaserie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nigo agoteeba iga: “Inche ninchiche mboorie abanto ba Sayoni, na abwo ba Yakobo baonchoke na batige ogosaria kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oko nakwo okobwatana kwane kw’ogotianania ndakore nabaanto abwo: Omoika one oyio ore igoro asore, na amang’ana aane aya nabekire ime ase omonwa oo, ayio takorua ase omonwa oo, gose ase emenwa y’abana bao, gose ase emenwa y’abachokoro bao, korwa bono goika kare na kare.” Nab’Omonene atebiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ISA.60",
    "number": "60",
